    contentLines: ["Omnivorous wild boars that dwell primarily in forests. Can be irascible and dangerous, if disturbed.","* * *","Armour Class","7 [12]","Hit Dice","3 (13hp)","Attacks","1 × tusk (2d4)","THAC0","17 [+2]","Movement","150' (50')","Saving Throws","D12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (2)","Morale","9","Alignment","Neutral","XP","35","Number Appearing","1d6 (1d6)","Treasure Type","None","* * *"],
