    rawText: "Large, hairy goblins with an ungainly gait. Favour attacking by surprise.\n* * *\nArmour Class\n5 [14]\nHit Dice\n3+1 (14hp)\nAttacks\n1 × weapon (2d4 or by weapon +1)\nTHAC0\n16 [+3]\nMovement\n90' (30')\nSaving Throws\nD12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (3)\nMorale\n9\nAlignment\nChaotic\nXP\n50\nNumber Appearing\n2d4 (5d4)\nTreasure Type\nB\n* * *\n- Surprise: On a 1-3, due to stealth.",
    contentLines: ["Large, hairy goblins with an ungainly gait. Favour attacking by surprise.","* * *","Armour Class","5 [14]","Hit Dice","3+1 (14hp)","Attacks","1 × weapon (2d4 or by weapon +1)","THAC0","16 [+3]","Movement","90' (30')","Saving Throws","D12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (3)","Morale","9","Alignment","Chaotic","XP","50","Number Appearing","2d4 (5d4)","Treasure Type","B","* * *","- Surprise: On a 1-3, due to stealth."],
