    rawText: "Horrific, hybrid monstrosities with the forequarters of a lion, the hindquarters of a goat, the wings of a dragon, and three heads: goat, lion, and dragon. Dwell in wild, hilly areas, or sometimes in dungeons.\n* * *\nArmour Class\n4 [15]\nHit Dice\n9** (40hp)\nAttacks\n2 × claw (1d3), goat: 1 × gore (2d4), lion: 1 × bite (2d4), dragon: 1 × bite (3d4) or 1 × breath (3d6)\nTHAC0\n12 [+7]\nMovement\n120' (40') / 180' (60') flying\nSaving Throws\nD8 W9 P10 B10 S12 (9)\nMorale\n9\nAlignment\nChaotic\nXP\n2,300\nNumber Appearing\n1d2 (1d4)\nTreasure Type\nF\n* * *\n- Attack pattern: Dragon head: 50% chance of breath attack, otherwise bites.\n- Breath weapon: Cone of fire: end 10' wide, 50' long. Can be used up to three times per day.",
    contentLines: ["Horrific, hybrid monstrosities with the forequarters of a lion, the hindquarters of a goat, the wings of a dragon, and three heads: goat, lion, and dragon. Dwell in wild, hilly areas, or sometimes in dungeons.","* * *","Armour Class","4 [15]","Hit Dice","9** (40hp)","Attacks","2 × claw (1d3), goat: 1 × gore (2d4), lion: 1 × bite (2d4), dragon: 1 × bite (3d4) or 1 × breath (3d6)","THAC0","12 [+7]","Movement","120' (40') / 180' (60') flying","Saving Throws","D8 W9 P10 B10 S12 (9)","Morale","9","Alignment","Chaotic","XP","2,300","Number Appearing","1d2 (1d4)","Treasure Type","F","* * *","- Attack pattern: Dragon head: 50% chance of breath attack, otherwise bites.","- Breath weapon: Cone of fire: end 10' wide, 50' long. Can be used up to three times per day."],
