    contentLines: ["Unintelligent crustaceans that lurk in coastal waters and creep along beaches. Cannot swim.","* * *","Armour Class","2 [17]","Hit Dice","3 (13hp)","Attacks","2 × pincer (2d6)","THAC0","17 [+2]","Movement","60' (20')","Saving Throws","D12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (2)","Morale","7","Alignment","Neutral","XP","35","Number Appearing","1d2 (1d6)","Treasure Type","None","* * *","- Ravenous: Attack any moving creature."],
