    name: "Dervish",
    slug: "Dervish",
    sourceUrl: "https://oldschoolessentials.necroticgnome.com/srd/index.php/Dervish",
    headings: [],
    categories: [],
    rawText: "Fanatically religious, nomadic people who wander steppes and desert regions, living in tents.\n* * *\nArmour Class\n6 [13] or 4 [15]\nHit Dice\n1 (4hp)\nAttacks\n1 × weapon (1d6 or by weapon)\nTHAC0\n19 [0]\nMovement\n120' (40')\nSaving Throws\nD12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (1)\nMorale\n10\nAlignment\nLawful\nXP\n10\nNumber Appearing\n0 (1d6+1 × 10)\nTreasure Type\nA\n* * *\n- Mounted: On warhorses.\n- Arms: 50% of group have: leather armour, shield, lance; 25% have: leather armour, shield, shortbow, sword; 25% have: chainmail, shield, lance.\n- Camps: Groups commonly combine and live in a camp or tribe of up to 300 dervishes, plus women, children, and animals. 25% chance of a wood or brick enclosure.\n- Camp leaders: Led by 10th level cleric.\n- Intolerant: Of other religious views.\n- Holy war: Occasionally wage war against other religious factions. Will slay people of different faith, or take them prisoner. Prisoners must convert; otherwise killed or used as slaves. Characters of Lawful alignment may be asked to join the holy war. Dervishes are highly suspicious of those who refuse (without good reason).",
    contentLines: ["Fanatically religious, nomadic people who wander steppes and desert regions, living in tents.","* * *","Armour Class","6 [13] or 4 [15]","Hit Dice","1 (4hp)","Attacks","1 × weapon (1d6 or by weapon)","THAC0","19 [0]","Movement","120' (40')","Saving Throws","D12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (1)","Morale","10","Alignment","Lawful","XP","10","Number Appearing","0 (1d6+1 × 10)","Treasure Type","A","* * *","- Mounted: On warhorses.","- Arms: 50% of group have: leather armour, shield, lance; 25% have: leather armour, shield, shortbow, sword; 25% have: chainmail, shield, lance.","- Camps: Groups commonly combine and live in a camp or tribe of up to 300 dervishes, plus women, children, and animals. 25% chance of a wood or brick enclosure.","- Camp leaders: Led by 10th level cleric.","- Intolerant: Of other religious views.","- Holy war: Occasionally wage war against other religious factions. Will slay people of different faith, or take them prisoner. Prisoners must convert; otherwise killed or used as slaves. Characters of Lawful alignment may be asked to join the holy war. Dervishes are highly suspicious of those who refuse (without good reason)."],
