    rawText: "3' long ferrets that hunt giant rats in their burrows. Sometimes kept by humans for this aptitude.\n* * *\nArmour Class\n5 [14]\nHit Dice\n1+1 (5hp)\nAttacks\n1 × bite (1d8)\nTHAC0\n18 [+1]\nMovement\n150' (50')\nSaving Throws\nD12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (1)\nMorale\n8\nAlignment\nNeutral\nXP\n15\nNumber Appearing\n1d8 (1d12)\nTreasure Type\nNone\n* * *\n- Volatile: Unpredictable temper; may turn on trainers or other people.",
    contentLines: ["3' long ferrets that hunt giant rats in their burrows. Sometimes kept by humans for this aptitude.","* * *","Armour Class","5 [14]","Hit Dice","1+1 (5hp)","Attacks","1 × bite (1d8)","THAC0","18 [+1]","Movement","150' (50')","Saving Throws","D12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (1)","Morale","8","Alignment","Neutral","XP","15","Number Appearing","1d8 (1d12)","Treasure Type","None","* * *","- Volatile: Unpredictable temper; may turn on trainers or other people."],
