    rawText: "Large, rapacious predators combining the features of an eagle (head, wings, front claws) and a lion. Prey on horses.\n* * *\nArmour Class\n5 [14]\nHit Dice\n7 (31hp)\nAttacks\n2 × claw (1d4), 1 × bite (2d8)\nTHAC0\n13 [+6]\nMovement\n120' (40') / 360' (120') flying\nSaving Throws\nD10 W11 P12 B13 S14 (4)\nMorale\n8\nAlignment\nNeutral\nXP\n450\nNumber Appearing\n0 (2d8)\nTreasure Type\nE\n* * *\n- Attack horses: Within 120', unless a morale check is passed.\n- Defend nest: Attack if it is approached.\n- Taming: Captured young can be trained as loyal mounts. Their fierce nature cannot be trained out: they still instinctively attack horses.",
    contentLines: ["Large, rapacious predators combining the features of an eagle (head, wings, front claws) and a lion. Prey on horses.","* * *","Armour Class","5 [14]","Hit Dice","7 (31hp)","Attacks","2 × claw (1d4), 1 × bite (2d8)","THAC0","13 [+6]","Movement","120' (40') / 360' (120') flying","Saving Throws","D10 W11 P12 B13 S14 (4)","Morale","8","Alignment","Neutral","XP","450","Number Appearing","0 (2d8)","Treasure Type","E","* * *","- Attack horses: Within 120', unless a morale check is passed.","- Defend nest: Attack if it is approached.","- Taming: Captured young can be trained as loyal mounts. Their fierce nature cannot be trained out: they still instinctively attack horses."],
