    rawText: "Diminutive, furry-footed demihumans who dwell in small villages (30-300 inhabitants).\n* * *\nArmour Class\n7 [12]\nHit Dice\n1-1 (3hp)\nAttacks\n1 × weapon (1d6 or by weapon)\nTHAC0\n19 [0]\nMovement\n90' (30')\nSaving Throws\nD8 W9 P10 B13 S12 (Halfling 1)\nMorale\n7\nAlignment\nLawful\nXP\n5 (guard: 20)\nNumber Appearing\n3d6 (5d8)\nTreasure Type\nV (B)\n* * *\n- Leader and militia: Villages are led by a halfling of level 1d6 + 1. A militia of 5d4 2HD guards is also present.\n- Hoard: Only have treasure type B when encountered in the wilderness.\nSee Halfling for the character class.",
    contentLines: ["Diminutive, furry-footed demihumans who dwell in small villages (30-300 inhabitants).","* * *","Armour Class","7 [12]","Hit Dice","1-1 (3hp)","Attacks","1 × weapon (1d6 or by weapon)","THAC0","19 [0]","Movement","90' (30')","Saving Throws","D8 W9 P10 B13 S12 (Halfling 1)","Morale","7","Alignment","Lawful","XP","5 (guard: 20)","Number Appearing","3d6 (5d8)","Treasure Type","V (B)","* * *","- Leader and militia: Villages are led by a halfling of level 1d6 + 1. A militia of 5d4 2HD guards is also present.","- Hoard: Only have treasure type B when encountered in the wilderness.","See Halfling for the character class."],
