    rawText: "Huge arachnids, as big as a small horse, with pincers and deadly stingers. Dwell in caverns, ruins, and deserts.\n* * *\nArmour Class\n2 [17]\nHit Dice\n4* (18hp)\nAttacks\n2 × claw (1d10), 1 × sting (1d4 + poison)\nTHAC0\n16 [+3]\nMovement\n150' (50')\nSaving Throws\nD12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (2)\nMorale\n11\nAlignment\nChaotic\nXP\n125\nNumber Appearing\n1d6 (1d6)\nTreasure Type\nV\n* * *\n- Aggressive: Normally attack on sight.\n- Poison: Causes death (save vs poison).\n- Grab and sting: +2 bonus to sting attack, if a claw hits.",
    contentLines: ["Huge arachnids, as big as a small horse, with pincers and deadly stingers. Dwell in caverns, ruins, and deserts.","* * *","Armour Class","2 [17]","Hit Dice","4* (18hp)","Attacks","2 × claw (1d10), 1 × sting (1d4 + poison)","THAC0","16 [+3]","Movement","150' (50')","Saving Throws","D12 W13 P14 B15 S16 (2)","Morale","11","Alignment","Chaotic","XP","125","Number Appearing","1d6 (1d6)","Treasure Type","V","* * *","- Aggressive: Normally attack on sight.","- Poison: Causes death (save vs poison).","- Grab and sting: +2 bonus to sting attack, if a claw hits."],
