    rawText: "Massive (12' to the shoulder, almost 40' long), aggressive, herbivorous dinosaurs with a protective crest behind the head, and three long horns. Dwell in Lost World grasslands.\n* * *\nArmour Class\n2 [17]\nHit Dice\n11 (49hp)\nAttacks\n1 × gore (3d6) or 1 × trample (3d6)\nTHAC0\n11 [+8]\nMovement\n90' (30')\nSaving Throws\nD10 W11 P12 B13 S14 (6)\nMorale\n8\nAlignment\nNeutral\nXP\n1,100\nNumber Appearing\n0 (1d4)\nTreasure Type\nNone\n* * *\n- Aggressive: Normally attack on sight.\n- Charge: In first round of combat, when not in melee. Requires a clear run of at least 20 yards. Horns inflict double damage.\n- Trample: 3-in-4 chance of trampling each round. +4 to-hit human-sized or smaller creatures.",
    contentLines: ["Massive (12' to the shoulder, almost 40' long), aggressive, herbivorous dinosaurs with a protective crest behind the head, and three long horns. Dwell in Lost World grasslands.","* * *","Armour Class","2 [17]","Hit Dice","11 (49hp)","Attacks","1 × gore (3d6) or 1 × trample (3d6)","THAC0","11 [+8]","Movement","90' (30')","Saving Throws","D10 W11 P12 B13 S14 (6)","Morale","8","Alignment","Neutral","XP","1,100","Number Appearing","0 (1d4)","Treasure Type","None","* * *","- Aggressive: Normally attack on sight.","- Charge: In first round of combat, when not in melee. Requires a clear run of at least 20 yards. Horns inflict double damage.","- Trample: 3-in-4 chance of trampling each round. +4 to-hit human-sized or smaller creatures."],
