    rawText: "Fantastic creatures that appear as elegant horses with a long horn. Unicorns are timid, but proud and wilful.\n* * *\nArmour Class\n2 [17]\nHit Dice\n4* (18hp)\nAttacks\n2 × hoof (1d8), 1 × horn (1d8)\nTHAC0\n16 [+3]\nMovement\n240' (80')\nSaving Throws\nD8 W9 P10 B10 S12 (8)\nMorale\n7\nAlignment\nLawful\nXP\n125\nNumber Appearing\n1d6 (1d8)\nTreasure Type\nNone\n* * *\n- Empathy with maidens: A pure-hearted maiden can communicate with and ride a unicorn.\n- Teleport: Once per day, up to 360' (including rider).",
    contentLines: ["Fantastic creatures that appear as elegant horses with a long horn. Unicorns are timid, but proud and wilful.","* * *","Armour Class","2 [17]","Hit Dice","4* (18hp)","Attacks","2 × hoof (1d8), 1 × horn (1d8)","THAC0","16 [+3]","Movement","240' (80')","Saving Throws","D8 W9 P10 B10 S12 (8)","Morale","7","Alignment","Lawful","XP","125","Number Appearing","1d6 (1d8)","Treasure Type","None","* * *","- Empathy with maidens: A pure-hearted maiden can communicate with and ride a unicorn.","- Teleport: Once per day, up to 360' (including rider)."],
